  - m_Id: 1002387353600
    m_Localized: "Preparing the orbital chart\u2026"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1002395742208
    m_Localized: Repair {0} ({1} Fe and {2} energy).
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1002395742209
    m_Localized: Storage is full. Build another warehouse and send the rover to unload.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1002404130816
    m_Localized: Explore the region to locate iron and ice.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1002404130817
    m_Localized: The orbital chart shows iron to the {0}, {1} sectors away. Send the rover to survey it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1002404130818
    m_Localized: Select the surveyed deposit and build a mine ({0} iron).
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1002404130819
    m_Localized: There is ice to the {0}, {1} sectors away. Send the rover to locate it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1002404130820
    m_Localized: Build an extractor to secure water ({0} iron).
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1002404130821
    m_Localized: Build a greenhouse to start harvesting (6 iron).
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1002404130822
    m_Localized: Explore and build to earn XP and reach level 3 ({0}/{1}).
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1002404130823
    m_Localized: Keep the colony alive until sol 7 (now {0}).
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1002404130824
    m_Localized: Check supplies and explore distant deposits to grow.
